<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-MZ">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Dionísio Daniel — Portfólio</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --preto:#0D0D0D;
    --preto-2:#171414;
    --branco:#FAF8F6;
    --branco-2:#EFEAE5;
    --vermelho:#C41E3A;
    --vermelho-escuro:#7A0C18;
    --grafite:#2B2828;
    --linha: rgba(250,248,246,0.14);
    --sombra: rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
  }
  :root{
    --bg: var(--preto);
    --bg-alt: var(--preto-2);
    --fg: var(--branco);
    --fg-dim: rgba(250,248,246,0.68);
    --card-bg: rgba(250,248,246,0.04);
    --card-line: rgba(250,248,246,0.14);
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
    scroll-padding-top:calc(64px + env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px));
  }
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--fg);
    font-family:'Work Sans', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    overflow-x:hidden;
    padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
  }
  img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
  a{color:inherit;}
  .wrap{
    max-width:1600px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 5vw;
  }
  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Anton', 'Work Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight:200;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
    margin:0;
    line-height:0.95;
  }
  .section-label{
    font-size:0.8rem;
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
    color:var(--vermelho);
    font-weight:600;
    margin-bottom:0.6rem;
  }
  section{
    padding:6.5rem 0;
    position:relative;
    border-top:1px solid var(--card-line);
  }
  section:first-of-type{border-top:none;}

  nav{
    position:fixed;
    top:0;left:0;right:0;
    z-index:100;
    background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 88%, transparent);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--card-line);
    transition:transform .35s ease;
    padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
  }
  .nav-inner{
    max-width:1600px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 5vw;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    height:64px;
  }
  .nav-name{
    font-family:'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-size:1.05rem;
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
  }
  .nav-name span{color:var(--vermelho);}
  .nav-links{
    display:flex;
    gap:2rem;
    list-style:none;
    margin:0;padding:0;
  }
  .nav-links a{
    text-decoration:none;
    font-size:0.88rem;
    color:var(--fg-dim);
    position:relative;
    padding:4px 0;
    transition:color .2s ease;
  }
  .nav-links a.active, .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--fg);}
  .nav-links a.active::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    left:0;right:0;bottom:0;
    height:2px;
    background:var(--vermelho);
  }
  .nav-toggle{display:none;background:none;border:none;color:var(--fg);font-size:1.6rem;cursor:pointer;}

    .hero{
    min-height:100svh;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    padding-top:calc(64px + env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px));
    border-top:none;
    position:relative;
  }
  .hero-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.25fr 0.9fr;
    gap:3rem;
    align-items:center;
    width:100%;
  }
  .eyebrow-hero{
    color:var(--vermelho);
    font-size:0.95rem;
    letter-spacing:0.04em;
    margin-bottom:1.1rem;
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6.2rem);
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .hero h1 .last{color:var(--vermelho);}
  .hero-role{
    margin-top:1.4rem;
    font-size:clamp(1.1rem,2.2vw,1.5rem);
    color:var(--fg-dim);
    max-width:34ch;
  }
  .hero-meta{
    margin-top:2.4rem;
    display:flex;
    gap:2.4rem;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .hero-meta div{font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--fg-dim);}
  .hero-meta strong{
    display:block;
    font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;
    font-weight:400;
    font-size:1.3rem;
    color:var(--fg);
  }
  .hero-cta{
    margin-top:2.6rem;
    display:flex;
    gap:1rem;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:0.5rem;
    padding:0.85rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius:2px;
    font-size:0.92rem;
    font-weight:600;
    text-decoration:none;
    cursor:pointer;
    border:1px solid transparent;
    transition:transform .18s ease, background .18s ease, color .18s ease, border-color .18s ease;
  }
  .btn-primary{background:var(--vermelho);color:#fff;}
  .btn-primary:hover{background:var(--vermelho-escuro);}
  .btn-ghost{border-color:var(--card-line);color:var(--fg);background:transparent;}
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--vermelho);color:var(--vermelho);}
  .btn:active{transform:scale(0.97);}

  .hero-photo-wrap{
    position:relative;
    justify-self:center;
    width:100%;
    max-width:380px;
  }
  .hero-photo-block{
    position:absolute;
    inset:14px -14px -14px 14px;
    background:var(--vermelho);
    z-index:0;
  }
  .hero-photo{
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
    aspect-ratio:3/4;
    overflow:hidden;
    border:1px solid var(--card-line);
  }
  .hero-photo img{
    width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;
    filter:grayscale(45%) contrast(1.05);
  }

  .reveal{
    opacity:0;
    transform:translateY(18px);
  }
  .reveal.in{
    opacity:1;
    transform:translateY(0);
    transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none;}
  }

  .about-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.1fr;
    gap:3.5rem;
    align-items:start;
  }
  .about-grid h2{
    font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .about-text p{
    color:var(--fg-dim);
    max-width:56ch;
    font-size:1.02rem;
  }
  .quality-list{
    list-style:none;
    margin:1.8rem 0 0;
    padding:0;
    display:grid;
    gap:0.75rem;
  }
  .quality-list li{
    display:flex;
    align-items:baseline;
    gap:0.7rem;
    font-size:0.96rem;
    color:var(--fg);
    padding-bottom:0.75rem;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--card-line);
  }
  .quality-list li::before{
    content:"";
    width:6px;height:6px;
    background:var(--vermelho);
    flex:none;
    margin-top:0.45em;
    border-radius:1px;
  }

  .tabs{
    display:flex;
    gap:0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--card-line);
    margin-bottom:2.5rem;
  }
  .tab-btn{
    background:none;
    border:none;
    color:var(--fg-dim);
    font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;
    font-size:1.15rem;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:0.9rem 1.6rem 0.9rem 0;
    margin-right:1.8rem;
    cursor:pointer;
    position:relative;
    transition:color .2s ease;
  }
  .tab-btn.active{color:var(--fg);}
  .tab-btn.active::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    left:0;right:1.8rem;bottom:-1px;
    height:2px;
    background:var(--vermelho);
  }
  .tab-panel{display:none;}
  .tab-panel.active{display:block;}

  .timeline{
    position:relative;
    padding-left:2rem;
  }
  .timeline::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    left:5px;top:6px;bottom:6px;
    width:1px;
    background:var(--card-line);
  }
  .t-item{
    position:relative;
    padding-bottom:2.2rem;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .t-item:last-child{padding-bottom:0;}
  .t-item::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    left:-2rem;top:5px;
    width:11px;height:11px;
    background:var(--bg);
    border:2px solid var(--vermelho);
    border-radius:50%;
  }
  .t-year{
    font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;
    color:var(--vermelho);
    font-size:1.1rem;
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
  }
  .t-title{
    font-size:1.08rem;
    font-weight:600;
    margin-top:0.25rem;
  }
  .t-desc{
    color:var(--fg-dim);
    font-size:0.92rem;
    max-height:0;
    overflow:hidden;
    opacity:0;
    transition:max-height .35s ease, opacity .3s ease, margin .35s ease;
    margin-top:0;
  }
  .t-item.open .t-desc{
    max-height:200px;
    opacity:1;
    margin-top:0.6rem;
  }
  .t-item .t-hint{
    font-size:0.78rem;
    color:var(--fg-dim);
    opacity:0.6;
    margin-top:0.2rem;
  }
  .skills-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:3rem;
  }
  .lang-row{
    margin-bottom:1.4rem;
  }
  .lang-row .lr-top{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    font-size:0.9rem;
    margin-bottom:0.4rem;
  }
  .lr-top span:last-child{color:var(--fg-dim);}
  .bar-track{
    height:6px;
    background:var(--card-bg);
    border:1px solid var(--card-line);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .bar-fill{
    height:100%;
    width:0%;
    background:var(--vermelho);
    transition:width 1.1s cubic-bezier(.22,.9,.3,1);
  }

  .avail-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:0.9rem;}
  .avail-list li{
    display:flex;
    gap:0.8rem;
    font-size:0.95rem;
    color:var(--fg-dim);
    align-items:flex-start;
  }
  .avail-list li::before{
    content:"✓";
    color:var(--vermelho);
    font-weight:700;
    flex:none;
  }

  .filter-row{
    display:flex;
    gap:0.7rem;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    margin-bottom:2.6rem;
  }
  .filter-btn{
    background:none;
    border:1px solid var(--card-line);
    color:var(--fg-dim);
    font-size:0.85rem;
    padding:0.55rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius:2px;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:border-color .2s ease, color .2s ease, background .2s ease;
  }
  .filter-btn.active{
    border-color:var(--vermelho);
    color:var(--fg);
    background:rgba(196,30,58,0.12);
  }
  .project-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap:1.6rem;
  }
  .project-card{
    border:none;
    background:transparent;
    padding:1.8rem;
    position:relative;
    z-index:0;
    overflow:hidden;
    transition:transform .25s ease;
  }
  .project-card::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    z-index:-2;
    left:-50%;
    top:-50%;
    width:200%;
    height:200%;
    background-repeat:no-repeat;
    background-size:50% 50%;
    background-position:0 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(var(--vermelho), var(--vermelho)),
      linear-gradient(var(--branco), var(--branco)),
      linear-gradient(var(--grafite), var(--grafite)),
      linear-gradient(var(--vermelho-escuro), var(--vermelho-escuro));
    animation:rotBorder 4.5s linear infinite;
  }
  .project-card::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    z-index:-1;
    inset:2px;
    background:var(--bg-alt);
  }
  @keyframes rotBorder{
    from{transform:rotate(0deg);}
    to{transform:rotate(360deg);}
  }
  .project-card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-3px);
  }
  .project-card:hover::before{
    animation-duration:1.6s;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .project-card::before{animation:none;}
  }
  .project-card .pc-tag{
    display:inline-block;
    font-size:0.72rem;
    letter-spacing:0.03em;
    color:var(--vermelho);
    border:1px solid var(--vermelho);
    padding:0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius:2px;
    margin-bottom:1rem;
  }
  .project-card h3{
    font-family:'Work Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:1.12rem;
    line-height:1.3;
    margin-bottom:0.7rem;
  }
  .project-card p{
    color:var(--fg-dim);
    font-size:0.92rem;
    margin:0 0 1.1rem;
  }
  .pc-stack{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:0.5rem;
  }
  .pc-stack span{
    font-size:0.74rem;
    color:var(--fg-dim);
    border:1px solid var(--card-line);
    padding:0.22rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius:2px;
  }
  .project-card.hidden{display:none;}

  .tech-chip-group{
    margin-top:1.6rem;
  }
  .tech-chip-cat{
    font-size:0.78rem;
    color:var(--fg-dim);
    margin:1.2rem 0 0.6rem;
  }
  .tech-chip-cat:first-child{margin-top:0;}
  .chip-row{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:0.55rem;
  }
  .chip{
    font-size:0.82rem;
    padding:0.4rem 0.85rem;
    border:1px solid var(--card-line);
    border-radius:2px;
    color:var(--fg);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px){
    .project-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px){
    .project-card{padding:1.4rem;}
  }

  .contact-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:3rem;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .contact-big{
    font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.4rem);
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .contact-list{list-style:none;margin:1.8rem 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:1rem;}
  .contact-list a{
    text-decoration:none;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    gap:0.8rem;
    padding:0.9rem 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--card-line);
    font-size:1rem;
    transition:color .2s ease, padding-left .2s ease;
  }
  .contact-list a:hover{color:var(--vermelho);padding-left:0.4rem;}
  .contact-list .cl-label{color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.82rem;}
  .copy-btn{
    background:none;border:1px solid var(--card-line);
    color:var(--fg-dim);
    font-size:0.72rem;
    padding:0.25rem 0.6rem;
    cursor:pointer;
    border-radius:2px;
    transition:border-color .2s ease, color .2s ease;
  }
  .copy-btn:hover{border-color:var(--vermelho);color:var(--vermelho);}

  .cv-card{
    margin-top:2rem;
    border:1px solid var(--card-line);
    background:var(--card-bg);
    padding:1.6rem;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:1.4rem;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .cv-card-title{
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:1.05rem;
    margin:0.3rem 0 0.4rem;
  }
  .cv-card p{
    margin:0;
    font-size:0.86rem;
    color:var(--fg-dim);
    max-width:32ch;
  }
  .cv-card .btn{white-space:nowrap;}

  footer{
    padding:2.2rem 0;
    text-align:center;
    font-size:0.8rem;
    color:var(--fg-dim);
    border-top:1px solid var(--card-line);
  }
  footer span{color:var(--vermelho);}

  @media (max-width: 860px){
    .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2.5rem;}
    .hero-photo-wrap{max-width:280px;order:-1;}
    .about-grid, .skills-grid, .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem;}
    .nav-links{
      position:fixed;
      top:calc(64px + env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px));left:0;right:0;
      flex-direction:column;
      background:var(--bg);
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--card-line);
      padding:1.2rem 6vw 1.6rem;
      gap:1rem;
      transform:translateY(-130%);
      transition:transform .3s ease;
    }
    .nav-links.open{transform:translateY(0);}
    .nav-toggle{display:block;}
    section{padding:4.2rem 0;}
    .hero-meta{gap:1.6rem;}
    .hero-cta{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;}
    .hero-cta .btn{justify-content:center;}
    .tabs{gap:0;}
    .tab-btn{font-size:1rem;margin-right:1.2rem;padding-right:1.2rem;}
    .timeline{padding-left:1.5rem;}
    .t-item::before{left:-1.5rem;}
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px){
    .wrap{padding:0 5vw;}
    body{font-size:15px;}
    .hero-photo-wrap{max-width:220px;}
    .hero-meta{flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;}
    .contact-list a{
      flex-direction:column;
      align-items:flex-start;
      gap:0.5rem;
    }
    .copy-btn{align-self:flex-start;}
    .nav-name{font-size:0.95rem;}
    .filter-row{gap:0.5rem;}
    .filter-btn{padding:0.45rem 0.85rem;font-size:0.8rem;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav id="navbar">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <div class="nav-name">DIONÍSIO<span>.</span></div>
    <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <li><a href="#hero" class="active">Início</a></li>
      <li><a href="#sobre">Sobre</a></li>
      <li><a href="#percurso">Percurso</a></li>
      <li><a href="#projetos">Projetos</a></li>
      <li><a href="#competencias">Competências</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contacto">Contacto</a></li>
    </ul>
    <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Abrir menu">☰</button>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="hero" id="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow-hero">Assistente Técnico</div>
      <h1>DIONÍSIO<br>DANIEL <span class="last">VILANCULO</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-role">Apoio técnico e atendimento, sempre pronto para o que a equipa precisar</p>
      <div class="hero-meta">
        <div><strong>2023</strong>Início de carreira</div>
        <div><strong>4</strong>Idiomas</div>
        <div><strong>Vilankulos</strong>Naturalidade</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-primary">Falar comigo</a>
        <a href="#percurso" class="btn btn-ghost">Ver percurso</a>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" id="cvDownloadHero">Baixar CV </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-photo-wrap reveal">
      <div class="hero-photo-block"></div>
      <div class="hero-photo">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Dionísio Daniel Vilanculo">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="sobre">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="section-label">SOBRE</div>
      <h2 class="reveal">Quem é<br>Dionísio</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-text">
      <p class="reveal">Natural de Inhambane e residente em Katembe, Maputo, Dionísio concluiu o 12º ano na Escola Secundária de 03 de Fevereiro e construiu experiência prática tanto na área técnica quanto no atendimento ao público — passando pela Procuradoria de Vilankulo e pelo Jens Bar Lodge.</p>
      <p class="reveal">Disponível para trabalhar em qualquer ponto do país, sob pressão e em qualquer área relacionada às vagas a que se candidata. Rápida adaptação, espírito de equipa e responsabilidade guiam o seu trabalho.</p>
      <p class="reveal">Na prática, isso passa por pequenos projectos de desenvolvimento web em HTML e CSS e por trabalho de rede — da crimpagem de cabos RJ45 à organização do cabeamento de um posto de trabalho.</p>
      <ul class="quality-list reveal">
        <li>Capacidade de trabalhar em equipa</li>
        <li>Muita vontade e facilidade em aprender</li>
        <li>Rápida adequação a novo ambiente de trabalho</li>
        <li>Respeito pelos colegas e superiores hierárquicos</li>
        <li>Alto nível de responsabilidade e espírito de dinamismo</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="percurso">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-label">PERCURSO</div>
    <h2 class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;">Formação &amp; Experiência</h2>
    <div class="tabs reveal">
      <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="formacao">Formação</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="experiencia">Experiência</button>
    </div>

    <div class="tab-panel active" id="formacao">
      <div class="timeline">
